BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (monthly subscription plus $100 for incremental storage and monitoring totals $6,000 annually; these are desk planning) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (assumptions, not vendor quotations. If verified automation saves ten contractor hours each month at an avoidable $60) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (hourly cost, the annual benefit is $7,200 and the direct contribution is $1,200 before implementation and review costs.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (Saved salaried time creates capacity, not automatic cash savings. Count it separately through faster qualified briefs or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (fewer overdue reviews. Keep this test inside the existing scenario cost envelope; otherwise the published margin must) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (change, so it cannot be presented as the canonical case. Use the $25,000 to $150,000 startup capital range to plan setup) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (and runway against the six-to-eighteen-month time to first deal. Neither range proves that the smallest capital budget) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (covers the longest delay. At $5,000 monthly operating expense, six months already consumes $30,000 before setup) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 457.17 Tm (costs or additional delivery spending. Favor engagement structures with earned, documented service milestones where) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.95 Tm (appropriate, and review contingent-fee restrictions before linking compensation to awards. A discovery platform cannot) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 426.72 Tm (cure payment delays or a fee arrangement that the procurement structure does not permit.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 411.50 Tm (Manage the pod through exception volume, not the number of scraped records. The data operator publishes a morning) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 396.27 Tm (source-health report and a deduplicated change queue. The capture lead reviews deadline and eligibility changes first,) Tj ET
