BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 365.82 Tm (a weekly P2 review. Measure collection freshness, missed amendments, unresolved identity matches, qualified briefs) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 350.60 Tm (per reviewer hour, supplier quotation expiry, and milestone exceptions. Set internal service targets from actual staffing) Tj ET
