BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 289.70 Tm (while preserving the authoritative manual fallback. Expand into another municipality only after existing active pursuits) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 274.47 Tm (have dependable coverage and a tested backup operator. At the Scaled case, assign added capacity to documented) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 259.25 Tm (bottlenecks such as supplier verification or bid review rather than assuming more sources produce proportionally more) Tj ET
